OL,3,AFormer DUP leader Donaldson sentenced
OL,4,Ato 15 years in prison for child sex
OL,5,Aabuse
OL,6,
OL,7,FJeffrey Donaldson has been sentenced to
OL,8,F15 years in prison for a series of
OL,9,Fchild sex offences, including one count
OL,10,Fof rape.
OL,12,FThe former DUP leader stood with his
OL,13,Fhands clasped in front of him in the
OL,14,Fdock of Newry Crown Court as his
OL,15,Fsentence was handed down.
OL,17,FJudge Paul Ramsey said Donaldson's
OL,18,Fcrimes had led to a "catastrophic
OL,19,Fdescent into disgrace".
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
