OL,3,AEight crew missing after drone attack
OL,4,Aleaves tanker ablaze off Romania's
OL,5,Acoast
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe west coast of the Black Sea has
OL,8,Frecently seen a spate of drone attacks.
OL,9,FA swarm of Russian drones was detected
OL,10,Fovernight not far from the scene, near
OL,11,FUkraine's Snake Island.
OL,13,FMoscow said two cargo ships with
OL,14,Fmilitary cargo heading to Ukraine's
OL,15,FOdesa port were hit during the sea
OL,16,Fcrossing. It did not name the vessels.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
